---
description: {{app_name}} Flutter architecture rules for Dart code
globs: lib/**/*.dart,test/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. For Dart files in particular:

- Layers: `presentation -> domain <- data`; features never import each other.
- Network only via `AppApiClient`; repositories return `Either<AppFailure, T>`.
- {{state_rule}}
- Navigate with `context.push(AppRoutes.x)`; never `Navigator.push`.
- Styling via `context.colors` / `context.appColors` / `AppSpacing`; text via `context.l10n`.
- New feature: `python3 tool/kickstart/add_feature.py --name <feature>`.
- Run `./scripts/quality_gate.sh` before finishing.

Detailed guidance: `.agents/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md`.
